{
 "id": "verification/nafems_le10",
 "title": "NAFEMS LE10: thick elliptic plate under pressure",
 "description": "NAFEMS standard benchmark LE10 (in mm). Quarter of an elliptic annular plate, 600 mm thick (z from -300 to +300). Inner boundary: ellipse (x/2000)^2 + (y/1000)^2 = 1; outer boundary: ellipse (x/3250)^2 + (y/2750)^2 = 1. Uniform normal pressure of 1 MPa on the upper face z=+300. Boundary conditions: uy=0 on the face y=0 (DCD'C'); ux=0 on the face x=0 (ABA'B'); ux=uy=0 on the outer elliptic face (BCB'C'); uz=0 on the line EE' where the outer face meets the mid-plane z=0 (the CAD face is split along that line).",
